 explain:`1) ${EQ(rx)}<br>2) n(${C(p[2])}) = ${N(rd(V,3))}/22,4 = ${n2(ng)} моль → n(${C(p[1])}) = ${n2(npure)} моль → m = ${N(rd(mpure,3))} г.<br>3) w(${C(p[1])}) = ${N(rd(mpure,3))}/${N(rd(msam,2))} = ${N(rd(1-wi/100,4))}; w(примесей) = 1 − ${N(rd(1-wi/100,4))} = <b>${wi} %</b>.`,
