 short:`n(Mg) = ${n2(x)} → ${N(rd(mMg,2))} г; MgO = ${N(rd(mMgO,2))} г → w ≈ ${N(rd(w,1))} %.`,
 explain:`Mg + 2HCl → MgCl₂ + H₂↑ (газ); MgO + 2HCl → MgCl₂ + H₂O (без газа).<br>n(H₂) = ${N(rd(V,3))}/22,4 = ${n2(x)} моль = n(Mg) → m(Mg) = ${N(rd(mMg,2))} г.<br>m(MgO) = ${N(rd(m,2))} − ${N(rd(mMg,2))} = ${N(rd(mMgO,2))} г; w = ${N(rd(mMgO,2))}/${N(rd(m,2))} ≈ <b>${N(rd(w,1))} %</b>.`,
